cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "composableIDModelR" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'composableIDModelR: Composable Infectious Disease Models via ''ComposableTuringIDModels.jl'''
version: 0.2.0.9000
abstract: Provides an R interface to 'ComposableTuringIDModels.jl', the composable
  probabilistic infectious disease modelling package of the 'EpiAware' ecosystem.
  Models are assembled in R from reusable latent process, infection and observation
  components, then simulated from and fitted to data in 'Julia' using 'Turing.jl',
  without requiring 'Julia' expertise.
